<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 9,315 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 1,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  166   (180 and 260)</p>
<p>    Good		130   (135 and 150)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     115   (120 and 124)</p>
<p>    Medium	    106   (109 and  88)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 85   (unq and  74)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 166 pence for a Rwanda PF1.</p>
</text>
